<view class="page"><view class="head-row"><button class="back" bindtap="back">‹</button><view><text class="head-title">编辑资料</text><text class="head-subtitle">仅用于校内交接和身份识别</text></view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{!loading}}"><view class="form-item"><text class="label">姓名或昵称</text><input class="field" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：林同学" value="{{form.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="inputChange"/></view><view class="form-item"><text class="label">学号（选填）</text><input class="field" maxlength="24" placeholder="仅自己可见" value="{{form.studentId}}" data-key="studentId" bindinput="inputChange"/></view><view class="row"><view class="form-item"><text class="label">宿舍楼</text><input class="field" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：3号楼" value="{{form.building}}" data-key="building" bindinput="inputChange"/></view><view class="form-item"><text class="label">房间</text><input class="field" maxlength="12" placeholder="例如：521" value="{{form.room}}" data-key="room" bindinput="inputChange"/></view></view><text class="privacy-note">资料仅用于本项目演示；正式上线前需接入微信登录和隐私授权。</text><text class="error">{{error}}</text><button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">{{saving ? '正在保存…' : '保存资料'}}</button></view><view class="empty" wx:else>正在加载资料…</view></view>
